DESCRIPTION:Get ready for a hilarious\, cross-continental comedy journey! T
 he Village Prince is the hit solo stand-up special by Sathish Kumar\, chart
 ing his chaotic transformation from a small-town boy in South India to a gl
 obal city dweller. Sathish grew up in a traditional village in Tamil Nadu\,
  India\, under the watchful eyes of ultra-strict Asian parents. Expecting a
  predictable path\, his life took a wild turn when he packed his bags to st
 udy horticulture in New York City\, eventually landing in Hong Kong.\nMore 
 info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/the-village-prince-a-stand
 up-comedy-show/
